                        "last_updated_date": "2026-07-16",
                        "notes": "The named mister-skinnylegs plugin is run once for each matched folder named Default that holds a Web Data file; a Chromium profile under any other folder name is not read. Where a description names the cache, that is the cache folder this module locates from the profile path: cache/Cache/Cache_Data or cache/Cache under the package folder for a profile below app_chrome, and cache/WebView/Default/HTTP Cache/Cache_Data or cache/WebView/Default/HTTP Cache for a profile below a webview or xwalk folder. For any other profile location no cache folder is searched for. When no cache folder is located the plugin is run without one, and what each plugin returns in that case was not established here. A profile for which the plugin raises a database or value error is logged and skipped. No rows does not establish that the site was not used.",
