                        "notes": "Timezone Offset (hours, truncated) is the stored timezone_offset value divided by 3,600,000, that is read as milliseconds and reported in whole hours with the remainder truncated. A +5:30 offset therefore renders as 5.\nUpload Status is the remote_media.upload_status value as stored; it is not a percentage.\nRemote URL is the remote_media.remote_url value with the text '=s0-d' removed where it occurs, so it is not shown exactly as stored.",
